          <msContents>
            <summary>Collection of works on magic: in Latin and English Original gilt stamped calf binding, lettered on cover 'Restat vincenti corona'. P. 15/16 cut out, but with no loss of text. Contents: Quaestiones quaedam ad daemonis sive genii cujusdam cognitionem adipiscendam, quas in vestibulo hujus libri affigere placuit. (3 ll.) Heywood (John). Of foreknowledge. (Epigram 76 of the 4th Centuria). De cura characteristica per imagines et sigilla (2 ll.). The book of Balemyn. De sigillis planetarum: in English, with pendrawings of sigils. Incomplete. (12 ll.) [Pseudo-Solomon.] Liber qui vocatur Shemamphoras. Incomplete. (2 ll.) Bacon (Roger). Regulae [magicae]. Incomplete. (3 ll.) Common-place book of extracts, in Latin. (12 ll).</summary>
